hin ko ek shot sikha diya", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:30:47Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "How do you drive in US. In India noone cares of the traffic lights", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:31:00Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "the top light is red, bottom is green", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:31:12Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "if they are horizontal, the left one is red, right one is green", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:31:21Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Omg crazy", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:32:11Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "i was a strategy consultant for a while… and you make a lot of PPTs in that line of work. so i had to let everyone know that i can’t see some shades", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:32:17Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "India mein you just buy a Creta", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:32:22Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "and ask my team to change colors so i can see them", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:32:23Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "How do you distinguish between green flags and red flags then?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:32:46Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "i can’t always. i can tell teh green and red apart in the Italian flag", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, 