.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "We totally take this stuff for granted", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:04Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Thank you universe\nFor letting me see colours", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:09Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "So pavan is it ulta for you?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:13Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Or both look like one colour", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:15Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Or what", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:19Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Royal decree\nColour's are restricted from now on.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:25Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "some shades or green and red look teh same to me", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:26Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Hahahahaha", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:39Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "But is the same red or green", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:35:43Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "and some shades of blue and green look the same to me", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]